An aide, not a companion
======================

"Companion" carries a claim about what the thing is for — company — and that is not the claim being
made. This is an aide: a special assistant that runs on your machine, keeps the thread, and does the
work. The word changes in the About panel and in the persona's own description of itself, so the app
and the file agree.

